@kaiser-ren Thanks for raising this. The immediate challenge is that the Zephyr Controller does not support PAST, so I'm unsure how feasible it is to create such a sample at this point, as it will not run with a pure Zephyr build. We can add a HCI host only sample, but I'm not sure that's very typical in Zephyr. @carlescufi Any comment to that? 

@cvinayak Do we have any timeline for the PAST feature in the Zephyr controller? 

What we could do, for now, is to extend the BT shell to have PAST support, if you need some kind of reference on how to use it.
